# CLI (`src/cli/`)

## Entry (`cli.ts`)

- Commands: `check` (inline args), `check-config` (YAML/JSON)
- Loads `.env.local` via `tsx --env-file-if-exists=.env.local` (see `package.json` scripts)
- Flags: `-r`, `-a`, `-o` (cli|json|html|all), `--output-dir`, `-t`, `--use-ai`, `--strict`

## Reporters

- `terminal-reporter.ts` — chalk output; show `AI mode:` line from `usedAI` / `aiInvoked`
- `json-reporter.ts` — full `AnalysisReport` JSON
- `HtmlReporter.tsx` — `renderToStaticMarkup(ReportView)`; keep styles inline/minimal for standalone HTML files

## Exit behavior

After successful analysis, default exit `0` even when non-compliant; `--strict` exits `1` for CI.

Do not import Next.js server code into CLI; only `src/core` + optional `src/web/report`.
